00:01:53.730 --> 00:02:00.340
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.130
What? A circus!?

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:11.650
Yeah, one stopped near my house.

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:15.660
I got the tickets, so someone bring me there!

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:21.100
I would've brought him with me, but I thought it'd be better if we all went together.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:21.850
That sounds good.

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:24.540
I'll go, I'll go, I'll <i>definitely</i> go!

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:25.040
Brat.

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.410
What's with the commotion, Amano-san?

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:28.800
Sorry!

00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:36.060
Sorry, Kashino.

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:43.560
recipe 23

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:43.560
Strawberry Illusion?

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:47.050
Circus, circus! It's gonna be so much fun~

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:49.320
Don't lose your direction and stray away.

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:50.270
Who would!?

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.240
Ichita!

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:52.780
Sen-nii!

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:55.610
Ichita-kun.

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:56.160
Yo!

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:57.820
How are you?

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:01.490
Hmpf. If it isn't the Cake Pig, Narcissist, and Mapo Tofu...

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:05.500
Your calling me Cake Pig again, huh!?

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:19.260
Ichita-kun and Ichigo-chan are...

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.350
...an unexpectedly good combination.

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:23.610
That's because kids go with kids.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:25.600
It's so dreamy.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.800
What's coming up next?

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:40.580
Amazing!

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.780
I made some cookies. Please have one.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.150
These cookies made by the Cake Pig...

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:51.130
I will force myself to eat one.

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:59.410
The star in that circus you've all been waiting for.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:02.570
From afar; the girl from France!

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:06.120
Amélie Joushou.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.690
She's so cute!

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:28.870
She's cute isn't she, that Amélie-chan.

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.360
She doesn't seem so to me.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.180
We're going to lose them!

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.570
Huh? Where's Ichigo-chan?

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:50.950
That girl has no sense of direction...

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:52.230
She's together with Ichita, right?

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:54.110
Andou-kun?

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:55.770
What? You're already outside!?

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:57.030
Yeah.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.780
Then we'll wait at the bus stop.

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:02.990
It seems to be moving really slowly.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:05.630
I know... Just wait for us at Yumetsuki.

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.400
I'll take Ichita-kun back.

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:08.200
Eh?

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.440
That's easier for us, but...

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.710
Is it okay to leave it to Amano?

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:15.260
It'll be fine. Well then...

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:16.660
See you later.

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:18.390
With that said...

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:21.120
Be sure to follow me closely.

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:23.140
Will we really be okay?

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:23.900
Now, let's go!

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:31.970
The circus was so interesting!

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.030
I want to see more!

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:36.010
Calm down, Caramel.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.910
Circus, circus.

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:38.500
Want to try it out together?

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.530
Let's do it! Let's do it!

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:41.950
Sounds good to me.

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:44.500
This is really fun!

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:45.760
Fantastic.

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:47.390
Wee~

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.620
Dive!

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:50.190
Beautiful.

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:52.370
Ya-hoo.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:54.280
Here I go!

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.700
Leave it to me!

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:57.590
Here I come!

00:05:57.860 --> 00:05:58.590
Perfect!

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:02.050
What are you doing!?

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:06.470
Paoon!

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.700
I'm an elephant!

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:11.000
Elephants don't talk!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.670
Paoon!

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:13.880
Cafe!

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:15.060
Chocolat!

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.530
Somersault!

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:17.110
Yes!

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:20.110
Magical circus, come out!

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.080
How was it, Kashino?

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.120
What did you think of our circus?

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:26.280
Yeah... I can do that, too.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:27.680
Really?

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.140
Kashino!

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:39.050
Where... are we?

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.510
I'm a fool for believing in the Cake Pig.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:44.930
Sorry.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.970
Use your cellphone and call them already.

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:48.220
T-That's right..!

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:53.400
Impossible!

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:55.940
Check your battery before going out!

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:58.630
This wouldn't happen if you didn't always think of cakes.

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:00.720
I'm so sorry.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:01.900
Eh?

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:03.940
You are...

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:07.540
The Girl from France, Amélie-chan!

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:09.860
Cute...

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:10.870
Huh?

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.330
S-S-Stop spacing out!

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:14.900
You know French, don't you?

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:16.730
Go and ask her for directions!

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:19.720
Umm... Umm...

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:25.140
Pardon, Mademoiselle? I am... I am...

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:26.470
What's wrong?

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:28.800
Can it be that... you two are lost?

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:30.090
Uhh...

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:31.610
What... is... wrong?

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:33.080
Can... it... be... that...

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:35.220
...you... two... are... lost?

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.210
No pao.

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:37.850
I am not to get...

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:40.430
Y-You're speaking Japanese!

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:45.000
Of course... After all, I've always lived in Japan.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.620
You're kinda small. How old are you?

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:49.040
What about you? How old are you!?

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:51.070
Me? I'm seven years old.

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:53.580
Me too.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:57.490
Have some.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.100
Wow, thank you.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:03.460
Delicious.

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:08.170
...but they called you <i>The Girl from France</i>.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.580
Well, it's not a lie...

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:11.850
I came to Japan when I was three.

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:17.310
As thanks for the cookies, I'll show you something cool.

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:19.520
Right now?

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:22.960
Come on. Don't be afraid, it's fine.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:24.730
I-I'm not afraid!

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:29.230
Whoa, they're still practising after the performance...

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:31.100
Mama!

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:34.740
Amélie.

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:36.260
Who's that?

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:37.940
Amélie's mama?

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:40.480
Wee.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:47.380
Yahoo!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.030
Sounds like you're hungry.

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:59.600
Oh my... Everyone's stomachs are grumbling, huh?

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:03.650
Here, dig in.

00:09:04.220 --> 00:09:05.890
Wow! It looks delicious.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.890
Thanks for the food!

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:09.860
It's my thanks for getting along so well with Amélie.

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:13.550
We keep touring around Japan like this...

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.870
...so she hasn't really had a chance to make friends.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.910
Isn't Amélie-chan going to school?

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:21.570
There is a school within the circus...

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:24.880
...but there isn't anyone the same age as Amélie.

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:27.210
There's a school in here, too?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.970
The exhibition in this town is only 'till next week...

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:31.800
...so feel free to come here and play.

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:32.970
Of course!

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:36.640
Hey... Why are you leaving the carrots?

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:39.830
It's because... I hate them.

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:41.840
It doesn't matter if you like or hate it.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:43.860
But, this is just food for rabbits!!

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:45.680
Oh my... This again...

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:49.140
Carrots contain a lot of Vitamin A for smooth skin...

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:52.150
...Beta-Carotene to protect against diseases and-

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:54.280
...and calcium and dietary fibers, right?

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:57.280
But I just don't want to eat the foods I don't like.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:00.080
Amélie won't eat carrots.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.090
You don't have the guts to eat it, huh?

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:04.920
This is how you eat them.

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:07.290
How's that?

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:11.210
Now, help yourself to your favorite salad.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.890
Wow! It's the spinach salad! I love it!

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:18.930
Pouring yogurt dressing makes it even more delicious.

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:23.230
Ichita-kun, help yourself to the spinach salad as well!

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:27.720
You hate spinach, don't you?

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:30.180
But it stinks! It's rabbit food!

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:33.190
You don't have the guts to eat it, huh?

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:36.660
How's that?

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:43.410
I know! How about I make a nice dessert as thank you for the meal?

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.580
Eh? Sure...

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:50.130
Ah! You're making vegetable sweets, right?

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.620
I found some Vanilla essence too.

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:53.800
Merci.

00:10:57.440 --> 00:10:59.320
Wow! It's cake!

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:00.770
A cake from the Cake Pig...

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:03.650
I'm not a pig! Not a pig!

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:07.020
You shouldn't call her pig.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:09.210
Right, Ichigo-oneesan?

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:11.930
Onee-san? As if.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.780
Please, help yourself.

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:17.270
Can't be helped. I'll eat it.

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:19.220
Thanks for the food!

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:22.570
Huh?

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:37.510
What's wrong? You two are making weird faces.

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:38.430
Does it taste bad!?

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.780
There's spinach in this, right?

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:41.870
Carrots too!

00:11:41.870 --> 00:11:43.140
H-How did you know?

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:46.850
The moment I felt the chewiness, I knew it was spinach.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:49.910
The smell of carrots is strong.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.190
Eh? Really?

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:57.780
Really? I don't really mind the spinach and carrots though.

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.910
Eh? Even with this smell?

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.240
You don't mind the chewiness?

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:05.920
I tried my best to cover the strong taste of spinach...

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:07.900
...and I even used Vanilla essence too.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:11.000
They might be sensitive to the stuff that they dislike.

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:15.330
Hello.

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:18.010
Lost children?

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.650
Sorry for intruding.

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:23.490
The curry was good, Ma'am.

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:24.760
Thank you.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.180
Be careful on your way home.

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:27.680
Yes!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.190
You'll come again to play, right?

00:12:29.590 --> 00:12:31.460
Yeah, I'll definitely come.

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.230
See you again!

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:33.940
Yumetsuki

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.730
What were you doing?

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.090
We couldn't get through to your cellphone...

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:39.700
We got worried, Ichigo-chan.

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:42.690
Sorry, sorry. Something happened on the way.

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:43.920
Sen-nii!

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:47.630
I fed an elephant and did some jumping on a trampoline!

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:51.690
But the Cake Pig made some terrible spinach cakes.

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:52.850
Terrible!?

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:55.590
Didn't you say 'It doesn't matter if you like or hate it' ?

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:58.010
You're making me look like a fool.

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.010
You had fun, didn't you.

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:01.090
Yeah! She even said "Come again and play" too.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:05.100
What could have gone wrong in that cake?

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:11.180
There's a lot of ways, but...

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:12.310
Hey, Ichigo.

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:13.770
What are you planning to do?

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:19.800
Ichita-kun dislikes spinach, and Amélie-chan dislikes carrots.

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:20.450
Thinking about it...

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:24.540
Yuck! It's so chewy...

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:26.920
In that case, the problem is the texture...

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:28.080
And for Amélie-chan.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:31.830
Yuck! It stinks of carrots all over it.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:34.110
The texture and smell, huh?

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:37.180
Anyway, I'm going to try it!

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:38.550
Good luck, Ichigo!

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:45.470
The one I made today was using ingredients for salad, so I used them raw...

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:46.680
This time I will boil it...

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:49.520
...then strain them into a paste using cheesecloth...

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:51.190
...so the texture should be settled!

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:55.690
I will seal the carrots by turning them into a paste...

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:57.880
To fix the smell, we'll use cinnamon, right?

00:13:57.880 --> 00:13:58.390
Yeah.

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:03.000
See? It turned out so pretty.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.000
It's great, Ichigo!

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:07.590
But they still might not like it.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:09.340
So then...

00:14:09.340 --> 00:14:11.120
Taste time!

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:13.320
Itadakimasu.

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:18.780
Hmm, somehow...

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:20.290
It's missing something in the taste...

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:26.300
It's like carrot and spinach walking together at dusk and getting lost in the streets.

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:27.730
What's with that?

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:29.810
Maybe we used too much cinnamon?

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:32.430
I have a feeling that's not the problem...

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:34.650
Yeah, you're right.

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:38.310
If we separate them, maybe it won't taste as bad.

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:39.770
Ching!

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:42.650
How's that now?

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:50.780
The carrot and spinach are trying their best to work together...

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:53.370
It feels like this didn't work out at all.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:59.030
Just say that carrot cake and spinach cake aren't supposed to be mixed already!

00:14:59.030 --> 00:14:59.970
Amano-san?

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:03.450
Ah! Vanilla's here too.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:08.010
I thought something was weird ever since you got back from the circus, but here you are.

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:13.120
Oh? Making cakes for those who hate carrot and spinach, huh?

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.690
Her mom will be happy.

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:16.520
It's awesome.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:21.900
It's only turning out so-so, but it seems I can't find a way to make it delicious.

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:25.350
At my home we always eat them in hamburger or stew.

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:29.740
Cause he always chomps down the food he likes, he never noticed it.

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:35.290
Hmm? Masking it with something you like?

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:42.820
Hey, does Ichita-kun like yogurt?

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:45.130
Yeah, he likes it...

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:47.720
What if I use yogurt in it?

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:49.960
Yeah. That's probably a good idea.

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:52.880
I've had a recipe since the first year, so let's use it as a reference.

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:55.420
Pour the yogurt in the batter.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:57.390
...and then the carrot!

00:15:58.550 --> 00:16:02.070
And add in the yogurt cream I got from my last lesson.

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:04.290
Then we'll add this in.

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:09.280
It became a pretty green colour.

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:14.850
Add a little more sweetness?

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:19.290
Yeah. Maybe not just sweetness, but I want something to change the smell as well.

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:22.750
How about peaches? We can use the mixer to blend it in.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.750
That's it! Peach has a good smell too.

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:38.730
How is it? Can you smell the carrots in it?

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:40.290
Nope.

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:42.510
You can't tell at all.

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:45.230
Instead I can faintly smell cinnamon, right?

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:47.750
This feels like it'll work out somehow.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:50.770
It's done.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:54.570
Now all that's left is the decorations, and it's done.

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.010
And then to taste it!

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:57.910
Yay! We're going to eat it!

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:07.490
Yeah. The spinach and carrots' presences are perfectly hidden,

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:12.490
and wrapped around with the fluffy texture from the yogurt cream.

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:16.390
Also, the combination of peach and cinnamon is refreshing!

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:18.560
Yeah. This is really great.

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:22.670
This is so delicious that I can eat a lot of it!

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:26.770
The cake for people who don't like spinach or carrots... The recipe is complete, isn't it?

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.830
Yeah. So then, without delay.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:34.490
How is it? Ichita-kun.

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:40.200
It doesn't taste bad coming from the Cake Pig.

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:41.690
Really?

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:43.830
Just be honest and tell her it's delicious.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.920
I will make some for Amélie-chan next time too.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:49.090
Eh? Then, let's make some for her by this Sunday.

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:49.860
Eh?

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:55.510
Amélie's circus is closing up after 8 p.m. this Sunday, then she's going far away.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.560
The cake is baked.

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:01.690
Let me help make the cream.

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:06.870
What do you want Choco to make, Kashino?

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:09.070
Satsuki is doing the Sweets Crafts.

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:10.480
Okay!

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:14.040
Wow. You're drawing with it.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.920
Shut it. I need to concentrate so keep quiet.

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:18.300
Good luck, Amano-san.

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:19.490
It's completed!

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:23.320
Ichita and Amélie are really cute~.

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:25.460
But the lines are rather messy.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:27.290
Don't tell her that.

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:29.290
Magical macaron.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.960
Sweets Romance Card.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:33.000
Come out!

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:47.100
Why won't the bus move?

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:50.740
If we don't hurry, Amélie will be gone!

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:53.150
We left early, and still... What time is it now?

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:54.410
It's 5 p.m... 5 p.m...

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.900
Ichita-kun! There's still two more stops left!

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:02.430
It's faster to run!

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:15.920
Amélie! It's time for us to set off.

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:21.430
But...

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.460
Ichita-kun! I'll carry that for you!

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:30.310
No way! I'll carry it to her!

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:38.230
Ah! Wait!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:39.910
Amélieee!

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:43.450
Ichitaaaa!

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:57.600
Take this, it's a cake made by Ichigo.

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:06.850
Heavy...

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:10.610
Thank you. Ichitaaa!

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:12.300
You'll come again, right?

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:13.860
Yeah, I'll come!

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:15.350
Promise me!

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:17.030
Yeah, I promise!

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:24.070
Don't cry, Ichita-kun.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.590
Like I'd cry!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.430
The drawing sucks.

00:20:48.820 --> 00:20:51.680
Thank you, Ichigo-oneesan.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:54.710
What? Just now, what did you call me?

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:58.240
It wasn't Cake Pig, but Ichigo-oneesan, right?

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:01.020
I didn't say that!

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:07.930
I won't forget that sparkling moment of them together.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:12.690
It'd be great if sweets could help by creating more and more of those moments.

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:17.170
I'm starting to love making sweets more and more, grandma.

